11. Complaints as field sensors

A complaint can be modeled as a localized discrepancy signal.

C_i
=
S_i^{expected}
-
S_i^{experienced}

A sufficiently dense cluster of independent complaints may reveal a regional field defect.

Therefore:

\text{complaints}
\rightarrow
\text{cluster}
\rightarrow
\text{shared invariant}
\rightarrow
\text{latent requirement}

Pantheon should mine complaints not merely for sentiment but for the hidden state transition the speaker wants.

