25. The plan

Pantheon should use SFT as the common substrate connecting its existing systems.

Incoming observations become field measurements.

Complaints become discrepancy sensors.

Goals become target regions.

Resources become reachable state transitions.

Relationships become coupling topology.

Semantic dialects become coordinate systems.

Golden Threads become invariants.

GoalSeek becomes inverse field control.

Goldilocks chooses magnitude and scale.

Reversible Interaction supplies the safety membrane.

Delta Observatory measures outcome.

Recursive Hindsight updates historical interpretation.

Pattern Sans Echoes separates recurrence from provenance.

Humility prevents successful navigation from being confused with authorship of the entire field.

The strategic advantage is not knowing everything.

It is becoming increasingly good at:

\textbf{seeing where change is possible}

\textbf{determining which scale matters}

\textbf{finding the smallest useful intervention}

\textbf{learning from propagation}

and

\textbf{transferring successful structure elsewhere}

